{"seq":1,"slug":"replication-models","title":"主从复制与多主复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/replication-models","wordCount":1381,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"主从复制与多主复制\">主从复制与多主复制</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>数据复制是分布式系统实现高可用性、低延迟和读扩展的基础机制。通过在多个节点上维护数据的副本，系统能够在部分节点故障时继续提供服务，并允许用户就近读取数据以降低延迟。复制的核心挑战在于：如何在多个副本之间保持数据一致性，同时不过度牺牲性能和可用性。</p>\n<p>本文系统介绍三种主流复制模型的架构设计、一致性保证和工程权衡，帮助工程师在实际系统中做出合理的复制策略选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"单主复制-leader-follower\">单主复制（Leader-Follower）</h3><p>单主复制是最广泛使用的复制模型，其核心规则简单：所有写入必须经过唯一的主节点（Leader），从节点（Follower）异步或同步复制主节点的变更日志。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    C1[&quot;Client Write&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;Leader&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt;|&quot;Replication Log&quot;| F1[&quot;Follower 1&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt;|&quot;Replication Log&quot;| F2[&quot;Follower 2&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt;|&quot;Replication Log&quot;| F3[&quot;Follower 3&quot;]&#10;    C2[&quot;Client Read&quot;] --&gt; F1&#10;    C3[&quot;Client Read&quot;] --&gt; F2&#10;    C4[&quot;Client Read&quot;] --&gt; L\">graph LR\n    C1[\"Client Write\"] --&gt; L[\"Leader\"]\n    L --&gt;|\"Replication Log\"| F1[\"Follower 1\"]\n    L --&gt;|\"Replication Log\"| F2[\"Follower 2\"]\n    L --&gt;|\"Replication Log\"| F3[\"Follower 3\"]\n    C2[\"Client Read\"] --&gt; F1\n    C3[\"Client Read\"] --&gt; F2\n    C4[\"Client Read\"] --&gt; L</pre><p><strong>同步复制 vs 异步复制：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>写延迟</th>\n<th>可用性</th>\n<th>典型配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全同步</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>高 (等待所有从节点确认)</td>\n<td>低 (一个从节点故障则阻塞)</td>\n<td>极少使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半同步</td>\n<td>较强</td>\n<td>中 (等待一个从节点确认)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>MySQL semi-sync</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全异步</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>低 (主节点立即返回)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大多数默认配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>复制日志格式：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于语句 (Statement)</td>\n<td>复制 SQL 语句</td>\n<td>日志紧凑</td>\n<td>非确定性函数问题</td>\n<td>MySQL 早期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于 WAL</td>\n<td>复制物理日志</td>\n<td>完全确定性</td>\n<td>耦合存储格式</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于行 (Row-based)</td>\n<td>复制数据变更行</td>\n<td>格式解耦</td>\n<td>日志量大</td>\n<td>MySQL ROW 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑日志 (CDC)</td>\n<td>结构化变更事件</td>\n<td>跨系统兼容</td>\n<td>额外解析开销</td>\n<td>Debezium</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多主复制-multi-leader\">多主复制（Multi-Leader）</h3><p>多主复制允许多个节点同时接受写入，每个主节点将变更异步复制给其他主节点。适用于多数据中心部署或需要离线写入的场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;DC Beijing&quot;&#10;        L1[&quot;Leader 1&quot;]&#10;        F1[&quot;Follower&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;DC Virginia&quot;&#10;        L2[&quot;Leader 2&quot;]&#10;        F2[&quot;Follower&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;DC Frankfurt&quot;&#10;        L3[&quot;Leader 3&quot;]&#10;        F3[&quot;Follower&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    L1 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Async Replication&quot;| L2&#10;    L2 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Async Replication&quot;| L3&#10;    L1 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Async Replication&quot;| L3&#10;    L1 --&gt; F1&#10;    L2 --&gt; F2&#10;    L3 --&gt; F3\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"DC Beijing\"\n        L1[\"Leader 1\"]\n        F1[\"Follower\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"DC Virginia\"\n        L2[\"Leader 2\"]\n        F2[\"Follower\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"DC Frankfurt\"\n        L3[\"Leader 3\"]\n        F3[\"Follower\"]\n    end\n    L1 &lt;--&gt;|\"Async Replication\"| L2\n    L2 &lt;--&gt;|\"Async Replication\"| L3\n    L1 &lt;--&gt;|\"Async Replication\"| L3\n    L1 --&gt; F1\n    L2 --&gt; F2\n    L3 --&gt; F3</pre><p><strong>冲突检测与解决策略：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>数据丢失风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Last Writer Wins (LWW)</td>\n<td>时间戳最大的写入胜出</td>\n<td>可接受偶尔丢失更新</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义合并函数</td>\n<td>应用层定义合并逻辑</td>\n<td>业务可合并的数据</td>\n<td>取决于实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRDT</td>\n<td>无冲突复制数据类型</td>\n<td>计数器、集合、文本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作转换 (OT)</td>\n<td>转换并发操作的顺序</td>\n<td>协同编辑</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突保留</td>\n<td>保存所有版本供用户选择</td>\n<td>CouchDB 风格</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>CRDT 示例 — G-Counter（增长计数器）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class GCounter:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;每个节点维护自己的计数器，总值为所有节点之和&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    def __init__(self, node_id, nodes):&#10;        self.node_id = node_id&#10;        self.counts = {n: 0 for n in nodes}&#10;&#10;    def increment(self):&#10;        self.counts[self.node_id] += 1&#10;&#10;    def value(self):&#10;        return sum(self.counts.values())&#10;&#10;    def merge(self, other):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;合并操作：取每个节点的最大值 (满足交换律和幂等性)&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        for node in self.counts:&#10;            self.counts[node] = max(self.counts[node], other.counts[node])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"每个节点维护自己的计数器，总值为所有节点之和\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node_id, nodes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {n: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nodes}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts.values())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, other):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"合并操作：取每个节点的最大值 (满足交换律和幂等性)\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[node] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[node], other.counts[node])</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"无主复制-leaderless\">无主复制（Leaderless）</h3><p>无主复制模型（Dynamo 风格）中没有固定的主节点，客户端直接向多个节点发送读写请求：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    C[&quot;Client&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Write to N nodes&quot;| N1[&quot;Node 1&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;Write to N nodes&quot;| N2[&quot;Node 2&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;Write to N nodes&quot;| N3[&quot;Node 3&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;Read from N nodes&quot;| N1&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;Read from N nodes&quot;| N2&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;Read from N nodes&quot;| N3\">graph TD\n    C[\"Client\"] --&gt;|\"Write to N nodes\"| N1[\"Node 1\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"Write to N nodes\"| N2[\"Node 2\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"Write to N nodes\"| N3[\"Node 3\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"Read from N nodes\"| N1\n    C --&gt;|\"Read from N nodes\"| N2\n    C --&gt;|\"Read from N nodes\"| N3</pre><p><strong>Quorum 机制：</strong></p>\n<p>给定 N 个副本，写入 W 个节点成功、读取 R 个节点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>当 <code>W + R &gt; N</code> 时，读取至少能获得一个最新值</li>\n<li>典型配置：<code>N=3, W=2, R=2</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"N=3 的常见配置：&#10;&#10;W=3, R=1: 写入必须全部成功，读取任一节点即可 (写慢读快)&#10;W=2, R=2: 平衡配置 (容忍一个节点故障)&#10;W=1, R=3: 写入极快，读取需要全部节点 (适合写密集)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>N=3 的常见配置：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>W=3, R=1: 写入必须全部成功，读取任一节点即可 (写慢读快)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>W=2, R=2: 平衡配置 (容忍一个节点故障)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>W=1, R=3: 写入极快，读取需要全部节点 (适合写密集)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>反熵修复机制：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读修复（Read Repair）</strong>：读取时发现过期副本，后台触发更新</li>\n<li><strong>反熵进程（Anti-Entropy）</strong>：后台线程周期性比较副本，修复差异</li>\n<li><strong>Merkle Tree</strong>：高效检测副本间数据差异</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"mysql-主从复制配置\">MySQL 主从复制配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 主节点配置 (my.cnf)&#10;-- server-id=1&#10;-- log-bin=mysql-bin&#10;-- binlog-format=ROW&#10;-- sync_binlog=1&#10;-- innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=1&#10;&#10;-- 从节点配置&#10;CHANGE MASTER TO&#10;    MASTER_HOST=&#39;master-host&#39;,&#10;    MASTER_PORT=3306,&#10;    MASTER_USER=&#39;repl_user&#39;,&#10;    MASTER_PASSWORD=&#39;repl_pass&#39;,&#10;    MASTER_AUTO_POSITION=1;  -- GTID 模式&#10;&#10;START SLAVE;&#10;&#10;-- 检查复制状态&#10;SHOW SLAVE STATUS\\G&#10;-- 关注: Seconds_Behind_Master, Slave_IO_Running, Slave_SQL_Running\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主节点配置 (my.cnf)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- server-id=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- log-bin=mysql-bin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- binlog-format=ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- sync_binlog=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- innodb_flush_log_at_trx_commit=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 从节点配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CHANGE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MASTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MASTER_HOST</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'master-host'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MASTER_PORT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3306</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MASTER_USER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'repl_user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MASTER_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'repl_pass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MASTER_AUTO_POSITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- GTID 模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">START</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SLAVE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 检查复制状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW SLAVE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\\G</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关注: Seconds_Behind_Master, Slave_IO_Running, Slave_SQL_Running</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"处理复制延迟的应用层策略\">处理复制延迟的应用层策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ReplicationAwareClient:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;应用层处理复制延迟的策略&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    def __init__(self, master_conn, replica_conns):&#10;        self.master = master_conn&#10;        self.replicas = replica_conns&#10;        self._last_write_ts = {}&#10;&#10;    def write(self, user_id, query):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;写入走主库，记录写入时间&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        result = self.master.execute(query)&#10;        self._last_write_ts[user_id] = time.time()&#10;        return result&#10;&#10;    def read(self, user_id, query, consistency=&#39;eventual&#39;):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;读取时根据一致性要求选择节点&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        if consistency == &#39;strong&#39;:&#10;            # 强一致性：总是读主库&#10;            return self.master.execute(query)&#10;&#10;        if consistency == &#39;read_your_writes&#39;:&#10;            # 读己之写：刚写入后短时间内读主库&#10;            last_write = self._last_write_ts.get(user_id, 0)&#10;            if time.time() - last_write &lt; 5:  # 5秒窗口&#10;                return self.master.execute(query)&#10;&#10;        # 最终一致性：读从库（负载均衡）&#10;        replica = random.choice(self.replicas)&#10;        return replica.execute(query)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReplicationAwareClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"应用层处理复制延迟的策略\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, master_conn, replica_conns):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.master </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> master_conn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.replicas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replica_conns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._last_write_ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, user_id, query):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"写入走主库，记录写入时间\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.master.execute(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._last_write_ts[user_id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.time()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, user_id, query, consistency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'eventual'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"读取时根据一致性要求选择节点\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consistency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'strong'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 强一致性：总是读主库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.master.execute(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consistency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'read_your_writes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 读己之写：刚写入后短时间内读主库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            last_write </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._last_write_ts.get(user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.time() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_write </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 5秒窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.master.execute(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 最终一致性：读从库（负载均衡）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        replica </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random.choice(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.replicas)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replica.execute(query)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"故障切换-failover-流程\">故障切换（Failover）流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Leader Failure Detected&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Automatic or Manual?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|Auto| C[&quot;Elect New Leader&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|Manual| D[&quot;Operator Promotes Replica&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;Check Replication Lag&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;Lag acceptable?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|Yes| G[&quot;Promote to Leader&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|No| H[&quot;Wait or Accept Data Loss&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;Redirect Writes to New Leader&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;Reconfigure Other Replicas&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;Old Leader Rejoins as Follower&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Leader Failure Detected\"] --&gt; B{\"Automatic or Manual?\"}\n    B --&gt;|Auto| C[\"Elect New Leader\"]\n    B --&gt;|Manual| D[\"Operator Promotes Replica\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"Check Replication Lag\"]\n    E --&gt; F{\"Lag acceptable?\"}\n    F --&gt;|Yes| G[\"Promote to Leader\"]\n    F --&gt;|No| H[\"Wait or Accept Data Loss\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"Redirect Writes to New Leader\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"Reconfigure Other Replicas\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"Old Leader Rejoins as Follower\"]</pre><p><strong>故障切换的风险：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>脑裂（Split-Brain）</strong>：两个节点都认为自己是主节点</li>\n<li><strong>数据丢失</strong>：异步复制场景下未复制的写入丢失</li>\n<li><strong>级联故障</strong>：切换过程中写入堆积导致新主过载</li>\n<li><strong>自增 ID 冲突</strong>：新旧主节点分配了相同的自增 ID</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"复制模型选择决策树\">复制模型选择决策树</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>推荐模型</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单区域，读多写少</td>\n<td>单主 + 多从</td>\n<td>简单可靠，读水平扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多区域低延迟写入</td>\n<td>多主复制</td>\n<td>就近写入，跨区域异步同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极高可用性要求</td>\n<td>无主 (Dynamo 风格)</td>\n<td>无单点故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线优先应用</td>\n<td>多主 + CRDT</td>\n<td>设备间最终合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金融级一致性</td>\n<td>单主 + 同步复制/Raft</td>\n<td>强一致性保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"监控关键指标\">监控关键指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Replication Lag</td>\n<td>从节点落后主节点的秒数</td>\n<td>&gt; 30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Replication Throughput</td>\n<td>复制日志传输速率</td>\n<td>下降 &gt; 50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Replication Errors</td>\n<td>复制错误计数</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Failover Duration</td>\n<td>故障切换耗时</td>\n<td>&gt; 30s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具/系统</th>\n<th>复制模型</th>\n<th>特色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MySQL Group Replication</td>\n<td>多主 (同步)</td>\n<td>Paxos 协议保证一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL Streaming</td>\n<td>单主 (异步/同步)</td>\n<td>WAL 流复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>Raft 共识</td>\n<td>强一致性多副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TiDB</td>\n<td>Raft (Multi-Raft)</td>\n<td>按 Region 分组复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cassandra</td>\n<td>无主 (Dynamo)</td>\n<td>可调一致性级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>单主 (Replica Set)</td>\n<td>自动故障切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vitess</td>\n<td>单主 + 分片</td>\n<td>MySQL 水平扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>复制模型的选择本质上是在一致性、可用性、延迟和复杂度之间的权衡。单主复制提供最简单的一致性模型，是大多数场景的默认选择；多主复制为多区域部署和离线应用提供了写入灵活性，代价是冲突处理的复杂度；无主复制通过去中心化实现了极致的可用性，但要求应用层处理数据不一致的情况。</p>\n<p>2026 年的趋势是越来越多的系统采用 Raft/Paxos 共识协议作为复制基础（如 TiDB、CockroachDB、etcd），在保证强一致性的同时通过 Multi-Group 机制实现水平扩展。工程师应当根据业务的一致性需求和部署拓扑做出选择，而非盲目追求&quot;最强&quot;的一致性保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主从复制与多主复制","id":"主从复制与多主复制"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"单主复制（Leader-Follower）","id":"单主复制-leader-follower"},{"level":3,"text":"多主复制（Multi-Leader）","id":"多主复制-multi-leader"},{"level":3,"text":"无主复制（Leaderless）","id":"无主复制-leaderless"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"MySQL 主从复制配置","id":"mysql-主从复制配置"},{"level":3,"text":"处理复制延迟的应用层策略","id":"处理复制延迟的应用层策略"},{"level":3,"text":"故障切换（Failover）流程","id":"故障切换-failover-流程"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"复制模型选择决策树","id":"复制模型选择决策树"},{"level":3,"text":"监控关键指标","id":"监控关键指标"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"列式存储与 OLAP 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/columnar-storage"},"next":{"title":"分区策略与再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/partitioning-strategies"}}